                        "name":  "dsh-macro-memory",
                        "title":  {
                                      "en":  "Macro Memory",
                                      "zh":  "宏记忆"
                                  },
                        "description":  {
                                            "en":  "One memory plugin instead of three: 8 unified memory_* tools and a single 1,235-character injection, with meow-memory\u0027s seven-layer SQLite as the main store and a rebuildable graph index. Tool schemas 56,759 B → 13,275 B (−76.6%), standing prompt 4,085 → 1,235 chars (−69.8%). Nothing was dropped: writes land in the main store first, graph links that cannot be written are queued instead of lost, and the setting page takes effect without a restart.",
                                            "zh":  "一个记忆插件顶三个：8 个统一 memory_* 工具 + 一段 1,235 字符常驻注入，主库仍是 meow-memory 的七层 SQLite，星图退成可重建的索引。工具 schema 56,759 B → 13,275 B（−76.6%），常驻注入 4,085 → 1,235 字符（−69.8%）。能力一条没砍：写入先落主库，连不上星图的连线排队不丢，设置页改完即刻生效、不用重启。"
                                        },
